  {
   "id": "10",
   "number": "7",
   "title": "Enactment Of By-laws – First, Second & Third Readings",
   "closed": false,
   "video_start": null,
   "video_end": null,
   "notes": [
    "<p>Council discussed the Region's current process of not posting by-laws online with the meeting agenda. Tim Brubacher, Regional Clerk, explained that the Region's process is outlined in the procedure by-law. By-laws are not attached but are always available for Council and the public.</p>\n<p>Council requested that for future Special Council meetings that are only for consideration of a by-law, that that by-law be attached with the agenda.</p>\n<p>Kedar Tupil was appointed as Acting Treasurer. A copy of the By-law is attached with the minutes.</p>"
   ],
